DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Du denkst, wir wären beste
Freunde?{{TAG:0007:0000:1E000000}} Nicht im Traum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Who do you think you are?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, sorry! I thought you were 
someone else. {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Nice to meet you!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ma chi ti credi di essere?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh! Scusa, ti avevo scambiat{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} per
qualcun altro. {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Che piacere incontrarti!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Für wen halten Sie sich eigentlich?!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Oh, Verzeihung!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ich habe dich mit
jemandem verwechselt...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Non posso credere che
{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}, il sindaco di questa
città, viva in una tenda!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Anche se guadagna una miseria.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
dovrebbe trattarsi meglio!

{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}} ha una casa favolosa!
Però mi chiedo se non si senta sol{{TAG:000E:0005:02006F0002006100}}
in un posto così grande.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0016:}}Sono certa che farebbe i salti
di gioia se mi autoinvitassi per cena!
{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Come dar{{TAG:000E:0005:060067006C00690004006C006500}} torto...

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}If you ask me, there are only two
times you should live in a tent. {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
When you're building a new house.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
or when you've knocked down your 
new house to build an even bigger 
one!{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
I'm not sure why {{TAG:0011:0000:0100}} lives
in one.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Maybe {{TAG:000E:0005:080068006500270073000A0073006800650027007300}} a nature lover!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Secondo me, vivere in una tenda
è accettabile solo in due situazioni.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Se stai costruendo una casa nuova.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
... o se ne stai costruendo una
ancora più grande!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Non capisco perché {{TAG:0011:0000:0100}}
viva qui.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Forse {{TAG:000E:0005:060067006C00690004006C006500}} piace stare
a stretto contatto con la natura!

EN:
Have you already visited 
{{TAG:0011:0000:0100}}'s place?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}It's small.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}but charming. The kind 
of place a hardworking {{TAG:0005:001F:00CD}}
can take pride in.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Hai già visto la casa di {{TAG:0011:0000:0100}}?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}È una di quelle abitazioni vecchio
stile.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} di un solo piano, ma spaziose.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}In una casa di quelle dimensioni,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
si possono tenere un sacco di cose.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
senza farla sembrare una discarica!

DE:
Kennst du {{TAG:0011:0000:0100}} schon?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:000E:0008:01CD0400650072000600730069006500040065007300}} wohnt hier im Ort in einem
äußerst passablen Haus.
Ein Stockwerk, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}aber viel Platz.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
So kann man viel unterbringen,
ohne dass es unübersichtlich wird.
